          "slot": "first",
          "props": {
            "markdown": "- A first habit, described in a few words\n- A second habit and what it costs\n- A third habit that seems faster"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "compare-b-title",
          "type": "heading",
          "slot": "second",
          "props": {
            "text": "The recommended way",
            "level": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "compare-b-list",
          "type": "text",
          "slot": "second",
          "props": {
            "markdown": "- The first change, described in a few words\n- The second change and what it brings\n- The third change, and why it is safer"
          }
        }
      ]
